ithub.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/enterprise-architecture","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/interoperability","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/registry","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/smart-guidelines","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-pc/product-master-data","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sc/traceability"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-e3c4f0ec36f35eccb0d4c50f887316e5.jsonld","name":"Global Platforms","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-ed45b0d35d7c5ccbbf4abe599a80be5c.jsonld","name":"National Product Catalogue","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-3ad41900b17d47f78129e16d32ed2f38.jsonld","name":"Components"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-02175c6feb9155618981ff120f954420.jsonld","name":"National Product Catalogue (DTH PC Fig. 2, Ch. 2-3)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-8c5dd12b8d4e425184f6003d0513d569.jsonld","name":"Interoperability Layer"}]},"reviewNotes":["F1: Two definitions of 'substandard medical product' — Glossary (p. ix, citing ref 9) states 'authorized by national regulatory authorities, but fail to meet either national or international quality standards or specifications – or, in some cases, both', whereas Introduction (p. 1, citing ref 23 WHA70/A70/23) states 'fail to meet either their quality standards or their specifications, or both'. Both are preserved as alternatives.","F3 (Polypharmacy orphan glossary entry): 'Polypharmacy' is defined on p. viii (citing ref 16) but never used in the handbook body text (pp. 1-59).","F6: Glossary entry for 'Registry' (p. viii) is truncated mid-sentence ('...canonical minimum data etc.').","F9 & F10: Term comparison with smart-ra (dpi-h-ra) recorded — 'enterprise architecture', 'interoperability', 'product' (ArchiMate business offering vs physical medical product homonym), and 'SMART Guidelines' carry distinct wordings across smart-ra and dth-sfp."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-front-matter","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Prose","doco:Section"],"label":"prose:sec-front-matter","kind":"prose","title":"Front matter (PDF pp. 1–6)","text":"p-sec-front-matter.md","meta":{"source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-front-matter.md","sectionId":"sec-front-matter","pageStart":1,"pageEnd":6,"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/suspect-product","term":"suspect-product"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/substandard-medical-product","term":"substandard-medical-product"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/falsified-medical-product","term":"falsified-medical-product"},{