is labelled 'Select type of report' (imperative task label) rather than a question; (4) step numbers 6, 7, 8 repeat on both parallel paths; (5) symbol usage violates Annex 3 rules. Redrawn cleanly in processes/SF-REP-001.bpmn while keeping Fig. 4 as the cited L1 figure."],"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-01","pers:sfp-r-13"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/bp-sf-rep-002","@type":["smart-base:BusinessProcess","doco:Figure"],"label":"bp:sf-rep-002","kind":"business-process","title":"SF-REP-002 — Receive, acknowledge and track SF report (Table 9, Table 12)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-026","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-12"],"text":"bp-sf-rep-002.md","meta":{"code":"SF-REP-002","processId":"Process_SF_REP_002","title":"SF-REP-002 — Receive, acknowledge and track SF report (Table 9, Table 12)","canonicalBpmn":"processes/SF-REP-002.bpmn","canonicalSvg":"processes/SF-REP-002.svg","bpmnFile":"bp-sf-rep-002.bpmn","svgFile":"media/SF-REP-002.svg","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-024-43-develop-business-processes-and-workflows.md","pdfPage":43,"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/business-process","term":"business-process"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/workflow","term":"workflow"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sc/traceability","term":"traceability"}],"glossaryTerms":["http