onld","name":"ALL High Level - Health Workforce"}]},"reviewNotes":["F2: Report type in Fig. 4 (p. 30) omits 'unregistered/unlicensed medical products' (the third WHO SF category defined on p. ix and p. 1), offering only substandard and falsified branches.","F5: Fig. 4 (p. 30 / PDF p. 42) has 5 BPMN 2.0 defects: (1) step 2 repeats gateway 1 ('Is the product registered?'); (2) gateway 1 has an unlabelled bypass arrow to the end event; (3) gateway 5 is labelled 'Select type of report' (imperative task label) rather than a question; (4) step numbers 6, 7, 8 repeat on both parallel paths; (5) symbol usage violates Annex 3 rules. Redrawn cleanly in processes/SF-REP-001.bpmn while keeping Fig. 4 as the cited L1 figure."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-025","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Prose","doco:Section"],"label":"prose:sec-025","kind":"prose","title":"Outline data requirements (PDF pp. 42–43)","text":"p-sec-025.md","meta":{"source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-025-44-outline-data-requirements.md","sectionId":"sec-025","pageStart":42,"pageEnd":43,"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/suspect-product","term":"suspect-product"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/report-type","term":"report-type"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp