 2 of 78 non-functional requirements (SFR.NFXNREQ.001, SFR.NFXNREQ.010) carry IDs in the source; stable IDs are assigned and flagged as assigned in the L2 blocks.","F7: End-of-chapter checklist copy-paste defect — Chapter 4's checklist (p. 35 / PDF p. 47) repeats 'Has a comprehensive current state analysis been conducted?' from Chapter 1.","F8: Undefined reference in Table 13 Interoperability category (p. 32 / PDF p. 44) — row 5 cites 'workstream 3 content (CQL + FHIR resources)', which is never defined in the handbook."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/pers-sfp-r-01","@type":["smart-base:Persona"],"label":"pers:sfp-r-01","kind":"persona","title":"SFP-R-01 — Doctor (ISCO-08: 2211, 2212)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-022","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-07","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-08"],"text":"pers-sfp-r-01.md","meta":{"roleId":"SFP-R-01","title":"SFP-R-01 — Doctor (ISCO-08: 2211, 2212)","isco08":"2211, 2212","personaType":"human","bpmnRoleId":"pers:sfp-r-01","bpmnLanes":[{"bpmnFile":"processes/SF-REP-001.bpmn","laneId":"Lane_SF_REP_001_HCP","processId":"SF-REP-001"},{"bpmnFile":"processes/SF-REP-002.bpmn","laneId":"Lane_SF_REP_002_Reporter","processId":"SF-REP-002"},{"bpmnFile":"processes/SF-REP-003.bpmn","laneId":"Lane_SF_REP_003_Reporter","processId":"SF-REP-003"}],"source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-022-41-identify-user-personas.md","sections":["sec-022","sec-023"],"pdfPages":[37,39],"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/doctor","term":"doctor"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"http