through DHSC Components (DTH SC Fig. 24)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-19be800d18a34a618d6e1955cf58e956.jsonld","name":"ALL High Level - Health Workforce"}]},"reviewNotes":["F3: Persona lists disagree across the handbook — §4.1 (p. 25) names 6 professions (doctor, nurse, pharmacist, pharmacy technician, dentist, public health worker); Table 7 (pp. 25-26) lists 3 (Doctor, Nurse, Individual/Patient); Table 8 (p. 26) lists 3 (CHW, Laboratory technician, Pharmacist); Table 9 (pp. 27-28) has 9 scenarios (adding Midwife and Paramedic); Annex 2 (p. 53) adds Veterinarians. All 12 reporting personas plus 3 regulatory/supply-chain/governance roles are unioned in SFP-R-01..SFP-R-15."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-08","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:table-08","kind":"table","title":"Table 8. Additional user personas: Community health worker, Laboratory technician, and Pharmacist (p. 26 / PDF p. 38)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-022"],"text":"t-table-08.md","meta":{"source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-022-41-identify-user-personas.md","pdfPage":38,"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/suspect-product","term":"suspect-product"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/report-type","term":"report-type"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-fe