tion/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-d79aa0eec0584b0792b44bca408afeb6.jsonld","name":"DPI-F Security & Consent Module","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-9cecae7a982548e1960a36ed41713a7c.jsonld","name":"Health Facility","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-2bdc635e575f5ec59bb5d6cbff12de78.jsonld","name":"Community Health","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-03e28af10b8f5b099e271461c8a99f21.jsonld","name":"Individual","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-66d0f91175c154b48413d57e9f952a34.jsonld","name":"Manufacturer / Distributor","type":"BusinessRole"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-3ad41900b17d47f78129e16d32ed2f38.jsonld","name":"Components"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-053fa0e33f6b5b0bb218195486c05160.jsonld","name":"Product Master Data Information Model (DTH PC Figs. 8-9)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-bea56e01c8345fbc803dee47a17ccfd3.jsonld","name":"Track and Trace through DHSC Components (DTH SC Fig. 24)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-19be800d18a34a618d6e1955cf58e956.jsonld","name":"ALL High Level - Health Workforce"}]},"reviewNotes":["F2: Report type in Fig. 4 (p. 30) omits 'unregistered/unlicensed medical products' (the third WHO SF category defined on p. ix and p. 1), offering only substandard and falsified branches.","F5: Fig. 4 (p. 30 / PDF p. 42) has 5 BPMN 2.0 defects: (1) step 2 repeats gateway 1 ('Is the product registered?'); (2) gateway 1 has an unlabelled bypass arrow to the end event; (3) gateway 5 is labelled 'Select type of report' (imperative task label) rather than a question; (4) step numbers 6, 7, 8 repeat on both parallel paths; (5) symbol usage violates Annex 3 rules. Redrawn cleanly in processes/SF-REP-001.bpmn while keeping Fig. 4 as the cited L1 figure."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-11","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:table-11","kind":"table","title":"Table 11. Core data dictionary for SF medical product reporting (SFR.A1.DE1–DE10, p. 31 / PDF p. 43)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-025"],"text":"t-table-11.md","meta":{"source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-025-44-outline-data-requirements.md","pdfPage":43,"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/suspect-product","term":"suspect-product"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/report-type","term":"report-type"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/anonymous-report","term":"anonymous-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/user-persona","term":"user-persona"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.githu