ed reporting channels and omits unregistered/unlicensed medical products.","F4: Missing definitions in Table 11 (p. 31) — SFR.A1.DE2 ('Type of report') and SFR.A1.DE5 ('Type of product') have empty Description and Data type cells, and SFR.A1.DE8 duplicates the label 'Type of report'."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-12","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:table-12","kind":"table","title":"Table 12. Functional requirements for an SF reporting system (SFR.FXNREQ.001–007, p. 31 / PDF p. 43)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-026"],"text":"t-table-12.md","meta":{"source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-026-45-gather-requirements.md","pdfPage":43,"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/suspect-product","term":"suspect-product"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/report-type","term":"report-type"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/anonymous-report","term":"anonymous-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/user-persona","term":"user-persona"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/business-process","term":"business-process"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/workflow","term":"work