(SFR.NFXNREQ.001, SFR.NFXNREQ.010) carry IDs in the source; stable IDs are assigned and flagged as assigned in the L2 blocks.","F7: End-of-chapter checklist copy-paste defect — Chapter 4's checklist (p. 35 / PDF p. 47) repeats 'Has a comprehensive current state analysis been conducted?' from Chapter 1.","F8: Undefined reference in Table 13 Interoperability category (p. 32 / PDF p. 44) — row 5 cites 'workstream 3 content (CQL + FHIR resources)', which is never defined in the handbook."]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-01","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-01","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 1: Doctor reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 39)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-01.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-01","persona":"pers:sfp-r-01","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":39,"stages":{"discovery":"Observes lack of therapeutic effect or unexpected adverse reaction in a treated patient.","reporting":"Opens the digital SF reporting app on clinic computer or mobile phone.","productDetails":"Selects the medicine from the product catalogue or enters product name, batch number, and expiry date.","uploadingPhotos":"Uploads photos of the medicine packaging, vial/blister, and label.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives immediate confirmation message and unique report tracking number.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives investigation updates from the NMRA and clinical guidance on affected batches."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/doctor","term":"doctor"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/doctor","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-01"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-02","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-02","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 2: Nurse reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 39)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-02.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-02","persona":"pers:sfp-r-02","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":39,"stages":{"discovery":"Notices discoloration, particulate matter, or defective seal while preparing an injectable or oral medication.","reporting":"Initiates an SF report on the ward tablet or mobile reporting application.","productDetails":"Scans the barcode or enters product name, batch number, and expiry date.","uploadingPhotos":"Takes and attaches photographs of the defective vial/ampoule and outer carton.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives submission confirmation and tracking number.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives alert feedback from pharmacy/NMRA on whether to quarantine remaining ward stock."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/nurse","term":"nurse"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/nurse","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-02"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-03","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-03","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 3: Individual / Patient reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 39)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-03.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-03","persona":"pers:sfp-r-03","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":39,"stages":{"discovery":"Purchases medicine with unusual smell, taste, crumbling tablets, or spelling errors on packaging, or experiences unexpected side effects.","reporting":"Accesses public web portal, mobile app, or USSD/hotline interface (with option for anonymous reporting).","productDetails":"Enters medicine name, where purchased, batch number, and expiry date if visible.","uploadingPhotos":"Uploads smartphone photos of the pills and packaging.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives confirmation receipt and tracking reference.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives plain-language advice to consult a health professional and status confirmation when reviewed."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/individual-patient","term":"individual-patient"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/individual-patient","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-03"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-04","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-04","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 4: Community Health Worker reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 39)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-04.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-04","persona":"pers:sfp-r-04","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":39,"stages":{"discovery":"During community outreach, identifies damaged or suspicious antimalarial/ORS/vaccine supplies or hears patient complaints of treatment failure.","reporting":"Opens mobile SF reporting app (using offline mode if in a low-connectivity village).","productDetails":"Selects product from simplified list and records batch number and expiry date.","uploadingPhotos":"Captures photos of the suspect pack and lot details.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives local queue confirmation and tracking number upon network sync.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives supervisor/NMRA notification on replacement stock and community guidance."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/community-health-worker","term":"community-health-worker"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/community-health-worker","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-04"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-05","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-05","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 5: Laboratory Technician reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 39)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-05.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-05","persona":"pers:sfp-r-05","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":39,"stages":{"discovery":"Detects erratic control results or physical defects in diagnostic test kits or laboratory reagents.","reporting":"Logs into the SF reporting system (with option to report anonymously if concerned about reprisal).","productDetails":"Enters diagnostic kit/reagent identifier, manufacturer, lot/batch number, and expiry date.","uploadingPhotos":"Uploads photos of the reagent lot certificate, cassette/strip defect, and packaging.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives confirmation and tracking number.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives regulatory follow-up regarding lot quarantine and laboratory quality alert."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/laboratory-technician","term":"laboratory-technician"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/laboratory-technician","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-05"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-06","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-06","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 6: Pharmacist reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 40)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-06.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-06","persona":"pers:sfp-r-06","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":40,"stages":{"discovery":"Identifies suspicious packaging, missing security seal, inconsistent batch/expiry printing, or patient return of ineffective medicine during dispensing.","reporting":"Submits structured SF report via pharmacy management system or dedicated NMRA reporting portal.","productDetails":"Scans GS1 barcode / GTIN or enters product ID (DE3), manufacturer (DE4), batch (DE6), and expiry (DE7).","uploadingPhotos":"Uploads high-resolution photos of primary/secondary packaging and supplier invoice details.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives tracking number and quarantine guidance.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives formal NMRA disposition (recall, quarantine release, or counterfeit alert)."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/pharmacist","term":"pharmacist"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/pharmacist","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-06"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-07","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-07","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 7: Dentist reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 40)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-07.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-07","persona":"pers:sfp-r-07","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":40,"stages":{"discovery":"Observes failure of local dental anaesthetic or abnormal consistency/packaging of dental medicine or material.","reporting":"Accesses digital SF reporting form via clinic workstation or smartphone.","productDetails":"Enters dental product name, manufacturer, batch number, and expiry date.","uploadingPhotos":"Uploads photos of the dental cartridge/vial and packaging.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives confirmation message and tracking number.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives NMRA follow-up on batch quality assessment."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/dentist","term":"dentist"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/dentist","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-07"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-08","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-08","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 8: Midwife reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 40)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-08.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-08","persona":"pers:sfp-r-08","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":40,"stages":{"discovery":"Observes lack of uterine contraction after administering oxytocin/uterotonic or notices compromised cold-chain/packaging integrity.","reporting":"Submits priority SF report via maternity ward mobile device.","productDetails":"Enters product name, strength, batch number, expiry date, and clinical observation (therapeutic failure).","uploadingPhotos":"Uploads photos of the ampoule and box.","confirmationAndTracking":"Receives immediate confirmation and tracking number.","followUpAndFeedback":"Receives urgent regulatory feedback and batch replacement instructions."},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/midwife","term":"midwife"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","term":"reporter"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","term":"sf-report"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","term":"tracking-number"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","term":"reporter-feedback-loop"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case","term":"use-case"}],"glossaryTerms":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/midwife","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/sf-report","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/tracking-number","https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/v0/ns#glossary/dth-sfp/reporter-feedback-loop","https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/use-case"],"archimate":{"model":"0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"agent-proposed by name, for working-group review (litlfred/dth-sfp#1)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-8e67c8e9e1195cdc857b03a2c640e7fe.jsonld","name":"National Regulatory Authority","type":"BusinessRole"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-22eff58eae365a4f8d0e0368d8c3497e.jsonld","name":"Regulatory Systems","type":"ApplicationComponent"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-6b78a242e71a428c87434e2fe5891ee2.jsonld","name":"Update Subscription/Notification","type":"ApplicationComponent"}],"views":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-92267636cc42566ca5d2cff0e81be8c9.jsonld","name":"DHSC Architecture Framework (DTH SC Fig. 14)"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/views/id-2d524cffba25509e82684f47d624cc42.jsonld","name":"Health Supply Chain Partners and Processes (DTH SC Figs. 1-3)"}]},"relatedBlocks":["pers:sfp-r-08"]},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-sfp/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/dth-sfp/blocks/scen-sfp-scen-09","@type":["smart-base:UserScenario"],"label":"scen:sfp-scen-09","kind":"user-scenario","title":"Scenario 9: Paramedic reporting a suspected SF medical product (Table 9, PDF p. 40)","uses":["papers/dth-sfp/blocks/prose-sec-023","papers/dth-sfp/blocks/tbl-table-09"],"text":"us-sfp-scen-09.md","meta":{"scenarioId":"SFP-SCEN-09","persona":"pers:sfp-r-09","source":"who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-023-42-define-user-scenarios.md","pdfPage":40,"stages":{"discovery":"Encounters defective emergency medicine or airway/infusion supply in an ambulance or field emergency with intermittent connectivity.","reporting":"Records SF report in the mobile app offline outbox (subprocess SF-REP-006).","productDetails":"Scans barcode or enters product name, batch number, and expiry date offline.","uploadingPhotos":"Attaches photos stored locally until connectivity is restored.","confirmationAndTracking":"App automatically syncs when online and delivers confirmation and tracking number.","followUpA